course: dictionary
lesson: 9811
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and swat is one of them. Read the words around it to find out which meaning fits. «Its eyes see movement very fast, which is why it is so hard to swat.» Here swat means to hit a fly with a quick slap.
explain: Swat can also be a noun, a name for the quick hit itself. «Dad gave the fly one quick swat with the newspaper.» The words fly, newspaper and quick all point to the hitting meaning.
explain: Capital letters are a clue too. «SWAT» in capitals is a special police team in the USA, not a slap. Check the capitals and the sentence together, then try your meaning in the sentence to see if it still makes sense.
fact: To swat means to hit something, usually an insect, with a quick hard slap using your hand or a flat object.
fact: A swat is a quick hit like that.
fact: A «fly swatter» is a tool people use to swat flies.
fact: SWAT in capitals is a special police team in the USA.
fact: Do not swat at bees or wasps, because swatting can make them sting. «If a wasp comes near, stay calm and move away slowly.»
exercise: «A housefly is hard to swat, because its eyes see movement very fast.» What does swat mean here? | *To hit with a quick hard slap | To catch in a jar | To smell | To fly very fast
exercise: «Dad gave the fly one quick swat with the newspaper.» What is a swat in this sentence? | A kind of fly | A loud noise | *A quick hit | A tool for cleaning windows
exercise: A wasp comes to your drink. What is the best thing to do? | Drink quickly before it lands | Swat it as hard as you can | *Stay calm, cover the drink and move away slowly | Wave your arms around
test: In a story, a giant swats people away like flies. What does this show about the giant? | He is scared of people | He is very kind | *Great strength | He is very small
test: «SWAT» is written in capitals in a news story about the USA. What does it mean? | A kind of insect | *A special police team | A fly swatter | A quick slap
exam: «Swatting at a bee or wasp makes a sting more likely.» Why should you not swat at a bee? | *Swatting can make it sting | Bees like being hit | It will fly away to tell its friends | Bees are too small to sting
